      "role": "user",
      "content": "the last time i took a smaller dose it didn't really do much for the cramps so i feel like i need a bigger dose to actually feel it. i'm not really seeing a doctor anytime soon because of my work schedule and insurance stuff, i just need to know if 1000mg is gonna be dangerous or if i can just take it tonight and see how i feel. i take a blood pressure med too, but i dont think that matters for magnesium right?",
